<div id="landing-page" class="relative min-h-screen overflow-hidden bg-[#030914] text-slate-100">
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_75%_5%,rgba(34,211,238,0.10),transparent_38%),radial-gradient(ellipse_at_12%_30%,rgba(59,130,246,0.07),transparent_30%)]"></div>
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-25 [background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(203,242,255,0.54)_0.6px,transparent_0.9px)] [background-size:49px_57px] [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_bottom,black,transparent_75%)]"></div>

  <header class="relative z-20 mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-5 border-b border-white/10 px-6 py-5 lg:px-10">
    <.link href={~p"/"} class="flex items-center gap-3" aria-label="Space Nova home">
      <div class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-xl border border-cyan-300/30 bg-cyan-300/10 shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(34,211,238,0.10)]">
        <.icon name="hero-rocket-launch" class="size-6 text-cyan-200" />
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-base font-black uppercase tracking-[0.23em] text-white">SPACE NOVA</p>
        <p class="text-[0.58rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.21em] text-cyan-300/70">A living solar system</p>
      </div>
    </.link>
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-xs font-semibold sm:gap-6">
      <a href="#explore" class="text-slate-300 transition hover:text-cyan-200">Explore</a>
      <a href="#flight" class="text-slate-300 transition hover:text-cyan-200">Flight &amp; combat</a>
      <a href="#future" class="text-slate-300 transition hover:text-cyan-200">What's next</a>
      <.link :if={!@current_player} href={~p"/register"} id="header-register-link" class="text-cyan-200 transition hover:text-white">Register</.link>
      <.link
        href={if(@current_player, do: ~p"/play", else: ~p"/login")}
        id="launch-client-link"
        class="rounded-lg border border-cyan-300/30 bg-cyan-300/10 px-4 py-2.5 text-cyan-100 transition hover:border-cyan-200/60 hover:bg-cyan-300/20"
      >
        {if(@current_player, do: "Enter cockpit", else: "Pilot sign in")}
      </.link>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="relative mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-10 px-6 pb-20 pt-16 lg:grid-cols-[0.95fr_1.05fr] lg:gap-10 lg:px-10 lg:pb-28 lg:pt-24">
      <div class="relative z-10">
        <p class="mb-7 inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full border border-cyan-300/20 bg-cyan-300/5 px-4 py-2 text-[0.65rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-cyan-200">
          <span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-300 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(103,232,249,0.8)]"></span>
          Solar system playtest
        </p>
        <h1 class="max-w-2xl text-5xl font-black leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.05em] text-white sm:text-6xl lg:text-[4.5rem]">
          Your ship.<br />
          Your choices.<br />
          <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-200 via-sky-300 to-indigo-300 bg-clip-text text-transparent">An entire system.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-7 max-w-xl text-base leading-8 text-slate-300 sm:text-lg">
          Take command in Space Nova. Chart a course between planets, encounter traders and hostile raiders, and fight to survive in a shared, evolving universe.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
          <.link
            href={if(@current_player, do: ~p"/play", else: ~p"/login")}
            id="primary-launch-link"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-cyan-300 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-extrabold text-slate-950 shadow-[0_16px_48px_rgba(34,211,238,0.16)] transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-cyan-200"
          >
            {if(@current_player, do: "Return to your ship", else: "Play in browser")}
            <.icon name="hero-arrow-up-right" class="size-4" />
          </.link>
          <.link
            :if={!@current_player}
            href={~p"/register"}
            id="hero-register-link"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-600 bg-slate-900/70 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-slate-100 transition hover:border-cyan-300/60 hover:text-cyan-100"
          >
            Create pilot account
          </.link>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-lg text-xs leading-6 text-slate-400">
          Playable in your browser today. The dedicated desktop client is in development.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-x-7 gap-y-3 border-t border-white/10 pt-6 text-xs font-medium text-slate-300">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2"><.icon name="hero-check-circle" class="size-4 text-cyan-300" /> Solar Atlas navigation</span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2"><.icon name="hero-check-circle" class="size-4 text-cyan-300" /> 3D &amp; stereo SBS flight</span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2"><.icon name="hero-check-circle" class="size-4 text-cyan-300" /> Live multiplayer</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-2xl">
        <div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute -inset-10 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 blur-3xl"></div>
        <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[1.8rem] border border-cyan-300/15 bg-slate-950 shadow-[0_35px_110px_rgba(0,0,0,0.55)]">
          <img
            src={~p"/images/landing/sol-approach.svg"}
            alt="Concept artwork of a spacecraft approaching a luminous planet in the Solar System"
            width="1200"
            height="820"
            class="aspect-[6/5] w-full object-cover"
            fetchpriority="high"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030914] via-[#030914]/90 to-transparent px-6 pb-6 pt-24 sm:px-9">
            <p class="text-[0.6rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-cyan-300/80">SOL SYSTEM / FLIGHT DECK</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-2xl">The journey is yours to command.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-center text-[0.65rem] tracking-wide text-slate-500">
          Original concept illustration — not an in-game screenshot.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="explore" class="relative border-y border-white/10 bg-slate-950/65 px-6 py-20 lg:px-10">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
        <p class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-cyan-300">EXPLORE</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">Nine worlds. One living Solar System.</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-base leading-8 text-slate-400">
          Start at Earth and set your sights on Mercury, Venus, Mars, Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus, Neptune and Pluto. Every journey crosses real territory and brings the chance of an unexpected encounter.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-10 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
          <article class="rounded-2xl border border-cyan-300/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-7">
            <.icon name="hero-globe-alt" class="size-8 text-cyan-300" />
            <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-bold text-white">Navigate the Atlas</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-400">Plot interplanetary courses and follow your ship across a complete map of Sol.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="rounded-2xl border border-cyan-300/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-7">
            <.icon name="hero-shield-check" class="size-8 text-cyan-300" />
            <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-bold text-white">Cross contested territory</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-400">Travel through planetary zones of control, where patrols and hostile vessels can intercept you.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="rounded-2xl border border-cyan-300/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-7">
            <.icon name="hero-signal" class="size-8 text-cyan-300" />
            <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-bold text-white">Meet other pilots</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-400">Share an authoritative multiplayer world with live navigation, ship movement and combat events.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="flight" class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-12 px-6 py-20 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:px-10 lg:py-28">
      <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-cyan-300/15 bg-[#07192c] p-8 sm:p-10">
        <div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_50%_60%,rgba(14,165,233,0.25),transparent_45%)]"></div>
        <div class="relative mx-auto flex aspect-square max-w-xs items-center justify-center">
          <div class="absolute inset-8 rounded-full border border-cyan-300/10"></div>
          <div class="absolute inset-14 rounded-full border border-dashed border-cyan-300/20"></div>
          <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-1/2 h-px bg-cyan-300/15"></div>
          <div class="absolute inset-y-0 left-1/2 w-px bg-cyan-300/15"></div>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 240 220" aria-hidden="true" class="relative w-48 drop-shadow-[0_0_45px_rgba(34,211,238,0.35)]">
            <path d="M120 12 148 84 218 137 149 123 120 210 91 123 22 137 92 84Z" fill="#133451" stroke="#67e8f9" stroke-width="3" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <path d="m120 32 13 77-13 43-13-43Z" fill="#9fe8f7"/>
            <path d="m82 121 22 64-38-48Zm76 0-22 64 38-48Z" fill="#1c6d91"/>
          </svg>
          <span class="absolute bottom-2 left-2 rounded-lg border border-cyan-300/20 bg-slate-950/80 px-3 py-1.5 font-mono text-[0.6rem] tracking-[0.2em] text-cyan-200">3D / SBS</span>
          <span class="absolute right-2 top-2 rounded-lg border border-cyan-300/20 bg-slate-950/80 px-3 py-1.5 font-mono text-[0.6rem] tracking-[0.2em] text-cyan-200">TACTICAL MODE</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-cyan-300">FLY &amp; FIGHT</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 max-w-xl text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">From the star chart to the cockpit.</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-slate-400">
          Interplanetary cruise carries you across Sol. When danger finds you, take direct control of your vessel in a true 3D combat arena, with laser weapons, enemy ships and an optional stereo side-by-side view.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[0.7rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-cyan-200">
          <span class="rounded-lg border border-cyan-300/20 px-3 py-2">3D flight</span>
          <span class="rounded-lg border border-cyan-300/20 px-3 py-2">Laser combat</span>
          <span class="rounded-lg border border-cyan-300/20 px-3 py-2">Stereo SBS</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="future" class="border-y border-white/10 bg-slate-950/60 px-6 py-20 lg:px-10">
      <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-start gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.85fr_1.15fr]">
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-cyan-300">ON THE HORIZON</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">A universe still expanding.</h2>
          <p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-400">Space Nova is an active playtest. We are building toward a richer multiplayer economy, deeper faction systems, new destinations and a dedicated desktop client.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-700/70 bg-slate-900/50 p-6">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sky-300">Planned</p>
            <h3 class="mt-2 font-bold text-white">Standalone desktop client</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">Local game assets, a dedicated launcher and eventual desktop distribution.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-700/70 bg-slate-900/50 p-6">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sky-300">Planned</p>
            <h3 class="mt-2 font-bold text-white">Deeper factions &amp; economy</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">Expanded progression, reputation and meaningful interplanetary commerce.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-700/70 bg-slate-900/50 p-6 sm:col-span-2">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sky-300">Future direction</p>
            <h3 class="mt-2 font-bold text-white">Beyond Sol</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">Additional star systems and new ways to cross the distance between them.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="join" class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20 lg:px-10 lg:py-28">
      <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-cyan-300/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#102b45] via-[#071726] to-[#050e1b] px-7 py-12 text-center shadow-2xl sm:px-12 sm:py-16">
        <div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_50%_10%,rgba(103,232,249,0.12),transparent_60%)]"></div>
        <div class="relative">
          <p class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-cyan-300">YOUR JOURNEY BEGINS HERE</p>
          <h2 class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">Ready to take the helm?</h2>
          <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">Create your pilot identity, claim your starter Sunracer and enter the Solar System.</p>
          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
            <.link :if={!@current_player} href={~p"/register"} id="register-link" class="rounded-xl bg-cyan-300 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-slate-950 transition hover:bg-cyan-200">Create pilot account</.link>
            <.link href={if(@current_player, do: ~p"/play", else: ~p"/login")} class="rounded-xl border border-white/25 bg-white/5 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-white transition hover:bg-white/10">
              {if(@current_player, do: "Enter cockpit", else: "Already a pilot? Sign in")}
            </.link>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="border-t border-white/10 px-6 py-8 lg:px-10">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-slate-500">
      <p>SPACE NOVA · An original multiplayer space-game project</p>
      <p>Solar System playtest · Desktop client in development</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</div>
